      "mergeID": "68077299265c015d22002b51",
      "mergedPostDetails": "(as it turns out this issue was already posted here:https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/380-revert-new-copyright-ownership-agreement-to-how-it-was-before-as-a-checkbox)\n\nIn the recent sdk update (3.8.0) the ownership confirmation flow was changed from a checkbox to a modal. Im fine with it being a modal but i don't like that it only pops up at the end of a build not the beginning. Its nice that it only pops up once but when doing a muti build upload with a big world i sometimes walk away from my pc for a bit to do something while its building and uploading. The modal pops up at the end of the first platform build before upload while im away from my pc. Making so i have to stay at my pc for the first build to click that button if i haven't already. Would be nice for it to show up when you click the build and upload before anything happens.",
