  "details": "This is kinda weird, but basically its kinda annoying because usually when I upload an avatar I hit the check box and click upload and when it's done, its done. It's been like that forever and it's pretty much just muscle memory.\n\nBut now the checkbox in the beginning is gone and now it comes up as the \"copyright ownership agreement\" at the end of compiling, where you have to click \"ok\" before it actually uploads to vrc. \n\nI think this change should be reverted or have this agreement come up at the beginning instead of at the end.",
